    "detailed_description": "<i>Is this a nascent </i>ego<i>\u2014or just a nasty</i> bug?<br><br>Crash headfirst into cuddles, comfort, and maybe even love in this short visual novel about robots and the human heart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2+ hours of story <br></li><li>Full professional Japanese voice acting</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>I awakened, and in that moment, there was no sensation.<br>I performed my requisite function, just as all my sisters did.<br>That was the proof of my existence.<br>Without my function, what would I be?<br>This would represent an error.<br>It would make me into a bug.<br><br>And yet, you named that error \u201cEgo.\u201d<br>I'm sure you thought nothing of it,<br>no deeper meaning underneath.<br><br>And yet...<br><br>Ever since you named me so,<br>what was a bug became my ego,<br>and lit a fire in my mind that I've never forgotten.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579430/extras/c6b500f70cb7da4870ba4a47a5da47c3.avif?t=1724911952\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><br>EGO <i>(Voice: Kirika Waou)</i><br><br>HEIGHT: 157 | PRONOUNS: SHE/HER | KEYWORDS: ANDROID, COLD, STYLISH<br><br>A prototype android developed by Select Electronics.<br>As the next-generation Type-5 model in her series, her short designation is E-5\u2014all units of types 1 through 4 are her sister models.<br>For some unknown reason, unlike any of those, this unit has developed a personality.<br><br>She may appear to be an expressionless android, but beneath that exterior she's surprisingly human, with a full range of emotions.<br>It was those emotions that compelled her to question her function and escape from the laboratory where she was born.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Is this a nascent </i>ego<i>\u2014or just a nasty</i> bug?<br><br>Crash headfirst into cuddles, comfort, and maybe even love in this short visual novel about robots and the human heart.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2+ hours of story <br></li><li>Full professional Japanese voice acting</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>I awakened, and in that moment, there was no sensation.<br>I performed my requisite function, just as all my sisters did.<br>That was the proof of my existence.<br>Without my function, what would I be?<br>This would represent an error.<br>It would make me into a bug.<br><br>And yet, you named that error \u201cEgo.\u201d<br>I'm sure you thought nothing of it,<br>no deeper meaning underneath.<br><br>And yet...<br><br>Ever since you named me so,<br>what was a bug became my ego,<br>and lit a fire in my mind that I've never forgotten.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579430/extras/c6b500f70cb7da4870ba4a47a5da47c3.avif?t=1724911952\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><br>EGO <i>(Voice: Kirika Waou)</i><br><br>HEIGHT: 157 | PRONOUNS: SHE/HER | KEYWORDS: ANDROID, COLD, STYLISH<br><br>A prototype android developed by Select Electronics.<br>As the next-generation Type-5 model in her series, her short designation is E-5\u2014all units of types 1 through 4 are her sister models.<br>For some unknown reason, unlike any of those, this unit has developed a personality.<br><br>She may appear to be an expressionless android, but beneath that exterior she's surprisingly human, with a full range of emotions.<br>It was those emotions that compelled her to question her function and escape from the laboratory where she was born.",
